<title>USA: Topeka &amp; Shawnee Library, Kan., won by Roosevelt.</title>
<headline>Topeka &amp; Shawnee Library, Kan., won by Roosevelt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roosevelt &amp; Cross, Inc said it won $5 million of Topeka and Shawnee County Public Library District, Kan., general obligation tem porary notes, Series 1996, with a net interest cost of 4.13 percent.</p>
